{
  "slug": "ai-adoption-playbook",
  "name": "Ai Adoption Playbook",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Structured AI adoption framework for leaders — diagnostic assessments, blocker analysis, rollout plans, and board-ready narratives",
  "longDescription": "Ships **14 skills** and **9 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (14): `90-day-plan-builder` (Use when a founder has diagnosed their AI adoption blockers and picked a first use case, and now…), `adoption-scorecard` (Use when a founder needs a quick snapshot of current AI adoption status for a board deck, leadership…), `blocker-diagnosis` (Use when AI adoption has stalled and the founder needs to understand specifically what's blocking their team —…), `board-ai-update` (Use when a founder needs to draft the AI section of a board update and already has results…), `board-narrative-coach` (Use when a founder is preparing for a board meeting and needs to present their AI adoption progress…), `data-readiness-check` (Use when a founder has picked an AI use case and needs to check whether the underlying data…), `first-use-case-picker` (Use when a founder needs to choose where to start with AI adoption — finds the highest-probability first…), `fluency-assessment` (Use when a leader responsible for AI adoption wants to understand where their team stands with AI tools…), and 6 more\n- **MCP servers** (9): `slack`, `atlassian`, `notion`, `microsoft365`, `asana`, `posthog`, `linear`, `box`, and 1 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install ai-adoption-playbook@claude-community` from `adimango/ai-adoption-playbook`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 14,
    "mcp": 9
  },
